<title>UK: T&amp;N sells Ferodo plant for five mln stg.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N sells Ferodo plant for five mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>International engineering group T&amp;N Plc has sold its Ferodo Caernarfon plant to American investors for five million stg cash payable on completion.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale of the clutch facing and friction products business will be put into a fund which has been established in respect of future asbestos-related disease claims.</p>
<p>T&amp;N said the sale of the plant, which employs 220 people in the Welsh town, will leave it better placed to concentrate on its core UK automotive friction products business.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
